WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:07.520
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going&nbsp;
to explain an Indonesian comedy-drama film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:15.920
called “Too Handsome to Handle.” Spoilers&nbsp;
ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:22.880
The Mas family has been good-looking for&nbsp;
several generations. They are admired by many&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:28.400
because of their beauty which in turn makes&nbsp;
them a lot of money. The eldest son, Okis,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:33.440
is an internet influencer. He has millions&nbsp;
of followers because of his looks and is also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:39.200
considered a love guru who helps men impress&nbsp;
their crushes. The father, Pakar used to be a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:44.400
heartbreaker who dated more than twelve hundred&nbsp;
girls before meeting their mother. Meanwhile,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:50.240
the mother can also be considered handsome because&nbsp;
of her masculine features and an obvious mustache.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:56.160
Lastly, the protagonist, Kulin is the youngest&nbsp;
son and the most attractive of them all. 
&nbsp;

00:00:56.160 --> 00:01:01.120
The family has gotten used to their life as people&nbsp;
with good looks. Except for Kulin, who struggles&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:06.400
to live normally because of his handsomeness.&nbsp;
He often wishes he was only mildly attractive;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:12.720
that way, he could go out without being chased by&nbsp;
a crowd of women every time. Girls go crazy, pass&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:17.760
out, pull their hair, and often get nose bleeds&nbsp;
on getting a look at his attractive face. 
&nbsp;

00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:25.360
As a result, he has never had genuine interaction&nbsp;
with a girl. He avoids going out in public as much&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:30.880
as possible and has been homeschooled till now.&nbsp;
Kulin has no friends he can talk to other than his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.880 --> 00:01:36.240
pet fish. He often plays cards with it and talks&nbsp;
to it out loud. His family watches him through a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:41.520
camera in worry. They want him to have a normal&nbsp;
teenage life and try their best to help him. 
&nbsp;

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:46.080
Okis frequently shows him pictures of girls,&nbsp;
trying to hook him up with someone. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:51.280
Kulin says that his type in girls is someone&nbsp;
who doesn’t like him. He wants to be seen for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:59.600
his personality and interest, not his face. 
When nothing works to motivate Kulin to go out,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:04.880
the family takes it a step further. They&nbsp;
plan to fake financial problems and guilt him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:09.680
into going to a school. One night when Kulin&nbsp;
wakes up to drink water, his parents pretend&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:13.600
to be worried about their finances. They&nbsp;
dramatically declare that they will only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:19.200
eat scrambled eggs for breakfast until they earn&nbsp;
enough money for Kulin’s homeschooling. He feels&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:23.840
awful to be causing his parents so much trouble.&nbsp;
The next morning, he declares that he will be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:29.280
going to school for the upcoming semester. The&nbsp;
family is overjoyed until he mentions that he will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:34.160
only go to an all-boys school. Although they would&nbsp;
have preferred him to be able to talk to girls,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:39.200
they are happy to take one step at a time. 
A few days later is Kulin’s first day at an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:44.640
actual school. Okis drops him off on his bike&nbsp;
but Kulin doesn’t take his helmet off. He plans&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:49.920
to wear it the entire day to hide the fact he&nbsp;
is handsome. However, the plan backfires when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:55.440
the helmet grabs more attention than he intended&nbsp;
to. Kulin quietly sits down in the last seat but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.440 --> 00:03:00.720
is called out by the class bully Sidi and his&nbsp;
minions. When the teacher enters the classroom,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:05.200
she too is surprised to see a guy with&nbsp;
a helmet. She urges him to take it off&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:11.440
right that instant. Although reluctant, Kulin has&nbsp;
no way but to oblige. He slowly takes the helmet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:19.200
off in a dramatic way, revealing his face.
In the following scene, the teacher is being&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:23.920
loaded into an ambulance. It turns out that she&nbsp;
started to nosebleed and hyperventilate because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.920 --> 00:03:28.560
of Kulin’s beauty. The other kids complain to the&nbsp;
principal that the new student is too handsome&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:34.400
to handle. Kulin runs through the hallway to go&nbsp;
back home but is tripped by one of the bullies.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:39.040
They bring him to the school’s storeroom and&nbsp;
introduce themselves like they are power rangers.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:44.720
They are called the Tiga Tak, a group of three&nbsp;
bullies led by Sidi, the principal’s son. After&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:49.200
the over-the-top introduction, they reveal&nbsp;
that they need Kulin’s help to ask a girl&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:54.080
out for prom. The group has been in the senior&nbsp;
year of school for the past three years. They&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:54.080 --> 00:04:00.400
refuse to graduate until Sidi goes to the prom&nbsp;
with the most beautiful girl of the BBM school,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:06.560
Amanda. However, she only accepts requests from&nbsp;
handsome men so the group wants Kulin to deliver&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:12.720
the promposal. They assign an innocent guy,&nbsp;
Kibo, to help Kulin and lead the way. Kibo has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:12.720 --> 00:04:17.920
also been a victim of their pranks in the past&nbsp;
and is obliged to do what the bullies say. 
&nbsp;

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:22.560
Afterward, Kulin goes to the principal’s&nbsp;
office with Kibo to make an official complaint&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:22.560 --> 00:04:27.920
about bullying in school. Kibo knows what the&nbsp;
outcome will be but he still accompanies Kulin.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:33.280
The principal is troubled by his son refusing to&nbsp;
graduate. Since Kulin’s beauty gives him a chance&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:37.280
to take Amanda to the prom, the principal&nbsp;
wants them to do whatever the bullies say.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:42.240
That evening, Kulin and Kibo decide to&nbsp;
complete the task the next day and get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:47.840
rid of the responsibility. Kibo is the first&nbsp;
person who has shown kindness to Kulin, unrelated&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:47.840 --> 00:04:52.720
to his beauty. Although the day didn’t go as&nbsp;
planned, he is happy to have gained a friend. 
&nbsp;

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:57.840
The next morning, they go to the BBM school where&nbsp;
the girls smell the presence of the boys. They are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:57.840 --> 00:05:03.120
strict about not allowing ugly boys to enter the&nbsp;
school premises. Hence, when they notice Kulin&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:08.720
wearing a helmet, the entire school asks him to&nbsp;
take it off. In a climactic scene, Kulin takes the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:16.240
helmet off and mayhem ensues among the girls. 
Only a few hours later, the news makes it to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.240 --> 00:05:21.120
television. Clips of girls crying, bleeding&nbsp;
through their noses, getting possessed,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:25.520
and jumping around are being shared all&nbsp;
around social media. Kulin starts being&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:31.200
known as the “too handsome to handle” guy. The&nbsp;
hottest student of the BBM school and model&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:37.440
named Amanda also hears the news and is instantly&nbsp;
smitten by Kulin. He is the first guy who matches&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:42.320
in beauty and status with her. She immediately&nbsp;
makes it her mission to impress him. 
&nbsp;

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:47.040
When the news becomes huge, a crowd of girls&nbsp;
gathers in front of the Mas residence. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:47.040 --> 00:05:52.240
family starts charging them money for a house&nbsp;
tour. Kulin, who is hiding in the streets, sees&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:58.560
his family on the news. He feels betrayed and used&nbsp;
by his own people. When they call him, he refuses&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:58.560 --> 00:06:04.560
to come home and feels even sadder when his pet&nbsp;
fish is mishandled and killed by the tourists.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:04.560 --> 00:06:09.920
He is now on the roof of a building hiding from&nbsp;
the maniacs chasing him in the streets. Suddenly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:09.920 --> 00:06:14.560
a girl appears behind him and inquires if he&nbsp;
is going to jump off the roof. Kulin looks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:19.360
at her in shock because she doesn’t bleed&nbsp;
from her nose or pass out on seeing him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:19.360 --> 00:06:25.280
The girl refuses to talk and simply walks away.&nbsp;
Kulin is so nervous that he can hardly speak.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:30.960
The encounter makes his day a lot better.
A while later, he calls Kibo who picks him up and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:35.840
invites him to his home. He and his grandmother&nbsp;
welcome Kulin to stay for as long as he wants.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:35.840 --> 00:06:41.120
On walking into Kibo’s room, he sees two rare&nbsp;
collectible playing cards and is amazed by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:41.120 --> 00:06:46.160
them. They realize that they share several common&nbsp;
interests and playing card collection is one of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:51.200
them. The following day, they visit the all-girls&nbsp;
school to look for the girl from yesterday. While&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:57.120
they are at it, they also meet Amanda and give her&nbsp;
the files of the promposal sent by Sidi. Amanda&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:57.120 --> 00:07:03.120
pretends to be unimpressed by Kulin’s beauty, but&nbsp;
after he leaves, her nose bleeds profusely. 
&nbsp;

00:07:03.120 --> 00:07:07.600
Kulin sees his crush on the stairs but the other&nbsp;
girls surrounding him do not allow him to meet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:07.600 --> 00:07:13.040
her. For the next few days, Kibo and Kulin do&nbsp;
everything together and become best friends.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:13.040 --> 00:07:19.040
One afternoon, Kibo takes Kulin to play futsal&nbsp;
where he frequently goes to meet his crush; Rere.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:23.440
After the match, Kulin notices the girl&nbsp;
from the roof working at a shop nearby.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:23.440 --> 00:07:29.440
He cannot help but stare at her. Just then,&nbsp;
Kibo arrives and introduces Rere to him. Kulin&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:29.440 --> 00:07:35.360
discovers that she is also Kibo’s crush who he was&nbsp;
talking about earlier. The two seem to be pretty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:40.560
close which makes Kulin jealous. He can hardly&nbsp;
fall asleep that night because the feeling is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:46.800
new and confusing to him. Then, he remembers Okis&nbsp;
is a love guru and fixes a meeting with him. 
&nbsp;

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:51.040
When they meet the following morning, Okis&nbsp;
breaks down crying tears of happiness. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:56.240
had been waiting for the day to give his brother&nbsp;
advice on girls. Kulin has forgiven his family&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:56.240 --> 00:08:01.120
for selling him out to his fans because if that&nbsp;
had not happened, he would have never met Rere.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:05.600
The brothers then go shopping for groceries&nbsp;
while Okis lists out the points of things&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:10.160
Kulin should do to impress his crush. 
As Kulin follows Okis’s suggestions,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:15.120
he registers he is far from knowing Rere like&nbsp;
Kibo knows her. But he still doesn’t want to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:20.160
give up on his first love. One afternoon,&nbsp;
Amanda comes to the boys’ school and hands&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:25.360
Kulin an invitation for her birthday. Alongside&nbsp;
it, she also gives him a phone as a gift. 
&nbsp;

00:08:25.360 --> 00:08:31.760
Later that day, Kibo, Kulin, and Rere go to&nbsp;
karaoke. Eventually, Rere and Kulin get to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.760 --> 00:08:37.120
sing together. While Kulin is excited to duet&nbsp;
with her, Rere only focuses on Kibo. He soon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:43.040
registers that she also likes Kibo back. The&nbsp;
revelation makes his heart crumple in jealousy.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:48.400
So, when Kibo is not around, he bluntly asks&nbsp;
her if she has a crush on him. Initially,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:54.000
Rere denies it but when Kulin lies about Kibo&nbsp;
being in love with Amanda, her face drops. Her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:54.000 --> 00:09:00.000
expression is enough to confirm his suspicions.
After returning home, Kulin calls Amanda and asks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:05.440
her for a favor. She happily agrees to do anything&nbsp;
he says. The next day, several people gather at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:10.800
the venue to celebrate her birthday. When Kulin&nbsp;
and Kibo arrive, Amanda welcomes them. Strangely&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:16.160
enough, she seems to be more interested in Kibo&nbsp;
than in Kulin. She even pulls him aside to talk&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:22.240
to him in private. At the same time, Rere arrives&nbsp;
at the party and sees Amanda kissing Kibo. 
&nbsp;

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:26.320
Heartbroken, she runs outside. Taking&nbsp;
advantage of her vulnerability,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:31.680
Kulin confesses his feelings for her. Rere&nbsp;
thanks him but claims that she never saw him as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:37.360
someone more than a friend. Even after conspiring&nbsp;
against his only best friend, Kulin gets nothing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:43.360
in return. The group of bullies also see Amanda&nbsp;
kissing Kibo and are enraged with jealousy and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:49.120
anger. They beat Kibo up for it while Kulin&nbsp;
watches from nearby, too scared to interfere.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:54.880
Later, he brings Kibo home and dresses his wounds&nbsp;
alongside his grandmother. Only after seeing him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:54.880 --> 00:10:00.640
moan in pain, does Kulin realize that he has&nbsp;
made a huge mistake. The next day, Kibo gives&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:05.680
him a legendary card from his card collection&nbsp;
that Kulin had been wanting for a long time.
&nbsp;

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:10.800
Guild-ridden, Kulin confesses to everything&nbsp;
wrong he has done till now. Kibo is shocked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:10.800 --> 00:10:16.080
and hurt by the betrayal. He claims that he would&nbsp;
have left Rere if he knew Kulin liked her too.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:16.080 --> 00:10:21.200
The words do nothing but hurt Kulin even&nbsp;
more. At last, Kibo orders him to get out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:25.440
of the house immediately. Knowing that he&nbsp;
is in the wrong, Kulin simply leaves. 
&nbsp;

00:10:25.440 --> 00:10:30.560
He finally returns home after a month. His family&nbsp;
is overjoyed but the same cannot be said for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:36.240
Kulin. He locks himself in his room and doesn’t&nbsp;
talk to anyone. But most of all, he misses his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:41.680
best friend. The two bump into each other at times&nbsp;
but never share anything more than a glance. 
&nbsp;

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:46.480
At home, Kulin’s mother is worried about his&nbsp;
well-being. She approaches him one night and gives&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:46.480 --> 00:10:52.160
him his pet fish that never died. She also tells&nbsp;
him that he can go back to being homeschooled&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:57.760
if that is what he prefers. The family only wants&nbsp;
his happiness and is ready to do anything for it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:57.760 --> 00:11:02.640
Kulin, touched by her words, realizes that he&nbsp;
has people in his life who are rooting for his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:08.160
success. This motivates him to make things right&nbsp;
between him and Kibo. The next morning, he runs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:13.600
to Rere and tells her everything. Following&nbsp;
that, he goes to Kibo and tries to apologize.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:13.600 --> 00:11:18.480
Although Kibo dismisses him at first, when asked&nbsp;
about Rere, he starts to describe how much he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:18.480 --> 00:11:24.240
loves her. Kulin shows him that Rere was listening&nbsp;
to him on the phone the entire time. That way,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:24.240 --> 00:11:28.320
he mends their relationship and goes&nbsp;
back to being both their friend. 
&nbsp;

00:11:28.320 --> 00:11:34.000
A few days later, they all go to prom together.&nbsp;
Kibo’s date is Rere while Kulin’s date is Amanda.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:43.840
As expected, Kulin and Amanda win the title&nbsp;
of prom king and queen. Kulin hears a girl&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:48.480
comment that he is only mildly handsome&nbsp;
and is instantly drawn to her, indicating&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:48.480 --> 00:11:52.640
the start of a new relationship. 
